1. e4 e6 2. d4 d6 { We study this position not only to be extra prepared against any black French side lines but also after a few moves black might go d5 transposing into a tempo down french (for black). } 3. Nf3 d5 4. Nbd2 (4. Nc3 Nf6 5. e5 Nfd7 6. Ng5 h6 (6... Be7 7. h4 h6 8. Nxe6) 7. Nxe6 fxe6 8. Qh5+) 4... Nf6 5. e5 Nfd7 6. Bd3 c5 7. c3 *


